<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Skoda plans CZK 2.5 bln share issue.</title>
<headline>Czech Skoda plans CZK 2.5 bln share issue.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech engineering concern Skoda a.s. said on Monday it was planning to increase its basic capital by 2.5 billion crowns to 12 billion through a share issue.</p>
<p>It did not give further details on the issue.</p>
<p>The company said in a published statement that it was calling a general shareholders' meeting for May 9 to decide on the issue.</p>
</text>
